          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 1, verse: 20, text: 'And he confessed, and denied not; but confessed, I am not the Christ.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 1, verse: 21, text: 'And they asked him, What then? Art thou Elias? And he saith, I am not. Art thou that prophet? And he answered, No.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 1, verse: 22, text: 'Then said they unto him, Who art thou? that we may give an answer to them that sent us. What sayest thou of thyself?'),
