          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 1, verse: 40, text: 'One of the two which heard John speak, and followed him, was Andrew, Simon Peter\'s brother.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 1, verse: 41, text: 'He first findeth his own brother Simon, and saith unto him, We have found the Messias, which is, being interpreted, the Christ.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 1, verse: 42, text: 'And he brought him to Jesus. And when Jesus beheld him, he said, Thou art Simon the son of Jona: thou shalt be called Cephas, which is by interpretation, A stone.'),
