          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 4, text: 'Jesus saith unto her, Woman, what have I to do with thee? mine hour is not yet come.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 5, text: 'His mother saith unto the servants, Whatsoever he saith unto you, do it.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 6, text: 'And there were set there six waterpots of stone, after the manner of the purifying of the Jews, containing two or three firkins apiece.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 7, text: 'Jesus saith unto them, Fill the waterpots with water. And they filled them up to the brim.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 8, text: 'And he saith unto them, Draw out now, and bear unto the governor of the feast. And they bare it.'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 9, text: 'When the ruler of the feast had tasted the water that was made wine, and knew not whence it was: (but the servants which drew the water knew;) the governor of the feast called the bridegroom,'),
          BibleVerse(bookId: 'JHN', chapter: 2, verse: 10, text: 'And saith unto him, Every man at the beginning doth set forth good wine; and when men have well drunk, then that which is worse: but thou hast kept the good wine until now.'),
